    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96728" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στημον-ίζομαι</span></b> , of the spider, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lay down the spokes of a circular
				web</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				623a9
			</span></i>.—
				Act.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στημονίζω</span> is expld. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπτύνω</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Zonar.
			</span></i>; but <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1770.64
			</span></i> has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στημονίζων</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίβων</span>
			, <i>threadbare garment.</i></div>
